                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>For an account of a visit in early 1954 of United States Representative to the
                    United Nations Trusteeship Council Mason
                        Sears to West <pb facs="0169" n="123" xml:id="pg123"/> Africa
                    including the Belgian Congo, French Equatorial Africa, French and British
                    Cameroons, Nigeria, French and British Togoland, and the Gold Coast, see
                        Sears’ memorandum of June 3, 1954 to
                    Assistant Secretary of State for United Nations Affairs David Key, <ref
                        target="frus:frus1952-54v03/pg_1383">volume III, page 1383</ref>.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
